{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：16:30 2026-10-22 HKT</p>\n<p>TVB台慶劇《璀璨之城》繼陳曉華與張智霖情慾戲、陳瀅「腿張開」兩幕話題性畫面後，張曦雯（Kelly）與張智霖（Chilam）的7分鐘半裸肉搏戲未播便已引爆網上熱話。然而，隨著更多幕後細節曝光，事件由演員專業度演變成討論TVB拍攝手法與職場權力，甚至有網民將早前袁澧林談及有男性前輩演員自行加戲強吻一事，與這次事件相提並論，引發網民熱議香港娛樂圈中的「#MeToo」問題。</p>\n<h2>張曦雯臨場被要求半裸 網民質疑監製陳維冠</h2>\n<p>張曦雯日前透露，為《璀璨之城》有突破性演出，率先劇透將有一場裸戲。據她分享，劇本原定只要求她拍攝穿內衣的戲份，在拍攝當日被監製陳維冠臨時要求「加碼」至半裸上陣兼一鏡到底。她坦言當下因尺度及心理關口而斷然拒絕：「No I don't think so, I'm not going to do it! 我唔拍，你哋自己Cut shot，我唔一Shot落。」導致拍攝一度停擺。網民普遍同情張曦雯的處境，質疑監製陳維冠為催谷收視，不惜罔顧演員意願，直斥：「用呢啲低俗方法拉收視」、「近年TVB好多不必要性侵節，根本CXS」、「最令人不安係報道寫劇本本身只係寫內衣，有乜野原因要停工改劇本」、「希望Kelly唔好唔開心，網民係撐佢嘅」、「呢套戲嘅監制係咪自肥？差唔多個個都要剝！有需要咩？」。</p>\n<img alt=\"張曦雯於《璀璨之城》將半裸除剩底褲肉搏張智霖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8271fe433ddcd1d6c712988fe673edd8/2026-10/1_4_93.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張曦雯曾一度拒演，其後獲袁詠儀及江美儀力勸拍裸戲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc23cb9abce06bd5c5c9db5ffcbc0854/2026-10/2_2_86.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張曦雯指該場戲被張智霖扯頭髮好羞辱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f36bbe7e6a3b578cd7ba56db1da27c7/2026-10/3_66.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張曦雯貢獻從影以來最性感演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce512bde038f1c7b6a63178f41f61ad2/2026-10/4_5_64.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/33a40475d36a4f879bf7410e0a87e3c5/2026-10/A_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"與張曦雯拍爭議裸戲場面的是張智霖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ca34a700ea7ff28c9b94d21ae50021b/2026-10/A_0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀與江美儀被質疑向施加張曦雯「壓力」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/751994d6cf2b7ea6b2abe18fa735a800/2026-10/XT5B4379.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖早前接受TVB娛樂新聞台訪問，被問到與陳曉華拍激情戲的感想，他笑言作為專業演員，太太袁詠儀（靚靚）並無陪同「試戲」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4aade4276509ef2001824d95d534f399/2026-10/VS--YouTube--YouTube-1_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"但就有全家總動員一同觀看：「有呀，一齊睇，刺激嘛！拍嘅時候已經好刺激，睇嘅時候都好刺激㗎嘛。我覺得我緊張啲，成家人，外父外母……一齊睇，嘩！好好睇呀！」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/90c04759af23a760b0a431802754da67/2026-10/VS--YouTube--YouTube-2_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖更生動地描述觀後反應：「好似都有一聲……倒抽一口涼氣嘅聲音，一完咗……（深呼吸）……全家人！」他形容情慾戲過後，全家氣氛反而「好歡樂」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a0abcc1eb2f7c8a12477ad76eef7a76d/2026-10/VS--YouTube--YouTube-1_28_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TVB台慶劇《璀璨之城》熱播中，剛播出即掀起話題。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c394c256cba97a6e996cfe69e9c656a/2026-10/09_0_16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖與多名女角有感情線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f6d6dd7eacd621ed4a8d648883fbdf4/2026-10/17_2_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"官孝賢（張智霖飾）好有艷福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/590c9febf1eb2233a5800c8c136f1473/2026-10/25_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"官孝賢（張智霖飾）首集即與郭芷媛（陳曉華飾）激烈擁吻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/14846d6c826ce6245c6bb8052a23a080/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_38_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"官孝賢（張智霖飾）的手更從女方腰間游走。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ddb818096cc437eedf20a637c9770076/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_48_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"甚至伸入裙內。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ad716321577daae033c6bde0a6effa3b/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_49_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭芷媛（陳曉華飾）狀甚享受。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8cc0369563305eee71c83dfa8904d81a/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_53_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"角度相當曖昧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ead3c425881cb850ebb64a689ec42afa/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-15_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"官孝賢（張智霖飾）與郭芷媛（陳曉華飾）雖然穿得密實，但二人互動卻相當有Feel。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/669cf6df9fe406411b87c8f9dc0f0acd/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-15_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曉華看上去極有袁詠儀年青時的樣子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7187adb60b5323715177787a839ab7a5/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-15_38_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>袁詠儀江美儀被質疑向施加張曦雯「壓力」</h2>\n<p>據悉，劇組其後因劇本問題停工三個月，期間經過監製陳維冠、張智霖、吳卓羲等人勸拍，最後由張智霖太太袁詠儀（靚靚）及視后江美儀搞飯局勸說下，張曦雯才點頭答應。二人以「角色更立體」為由說服，苦口婆心勸說：「拍啦，阿女，你應該要拍。」袁詠儀更承諾會親自監場，給予張曦雯更大安全感。然而，此舉卻引來網民大量批評，不少網民認為二人身為女性前輩，非但沒有支持後輩，反而施加「壓力」，慨嘆：「女人勸女人脫，完全理解唔到」、「完美展示一個系統性壓迫」、「點解一個女演員要用除衫去證明自己」、「陳瀅先最慘，網上劇照見到她的戲份意淫低俗，破壞形象」、「唔覺得個劇本有需要到咁多女演員去除衫囉」、「呢啲前輩以前後生可能畀唔少幕後臨時加床戲除衫戲，甚至做啲更過份嘅事都唔敢出聲，依家睇唔過眼啲後輩有得say no？」、「袁詠儀又唔係呢套劇嘅演員又唔係監製，其實關佢咩事」、「Chilam搵老婆做說客，叫對手除衫？好噁心」。</p>\n<h2>璀璨之城丨陳瀅「腿張開」戲份引起話題：</h2>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅為了與張智霖達成利益交易，見面時先交出手機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9de424f6f6c84f9891313000cd918532/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-39_07_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅主動上演一幕極致大膽的「全裸誘惑」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83743d39e7bdff9a3ca23bbdcf29ea5a/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅主動除衫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec2a0bf2664d3da794b445574fb1d008/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅先露出黑bra。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/069c4b785d8fff50b28620a68d4e9886/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅再除下牛仔褲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c0a860436763614915049fcb334c21cf/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅露出蜜桃臀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b60bf2304a1174ede90d77d2272bf24f/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_43_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖一臉嫌棄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0a392d28d7c5b83b89ec34e6d6353ea/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_56_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅繼續出招。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af8eec1a8833823d1ededd8c650d96d9/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖冷眼看陳瀅下一步行動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1c10c13a7b96c17a14dcbb4ad8b6ee0/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅準備坐在床上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cecd73e938289986dabac79ba39a60f3/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅準備除下內褲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8149e85dc649e4f12896e9152e9fd23f/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"意識相當大膽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d29a5dfd593bded778b4c5d294d82103/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅解開胸罩背扣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f4b85d35644c9fbb3f1b10702f44edce/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅大晒玉背。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ccb8f8e39a22a94262b1e4541a6ac078/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅盡騷一流身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/788683d4835a23c8b9991bcb0bc64722/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅即將一絲不掛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6c2e91f929731a4b6aee6e1e55d2f7f/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_26_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅將身上衣物全數脫光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aca8a442d4b89f2bc87ddb838be0aa61/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅躺在床上腿張開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/adefb06c8d8aaa2aa0d4695f5ba845b2/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_32_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅任影唔嬲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7bfaf8f92d5af7d2835c6620e6a2455c/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_57_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"首次挑戰大膽除衫戲，陳瀅坦言現場緊張萬分。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/583bea3e5581a451cd8e3929fb751ac0/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-42_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅又稱收到劇本已經很喜歡這場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cca90a71763a069064ec774e63063377/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-42_05_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T11:01:04.060442+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1014,"images":41,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T12:58:01.194321+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T10:57:53.932381+00:00","content_hash":"abd5856e452a9082b28733fb8b14793b446f39eb96fdb165bb71355d346bb20b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}